    cards.push(wkCard("accounts", "🌍", "One account, every server", wkNote("Your account is made once, on the main server: name, password and (if the server asks) a confirmed email. After logging in you choose a server. Only then is your player on that server made: you pick a tribe and land. Playing on another server later is one tap, with no second password and no second mail. Every server has its own colonies, heroes, speed, rounds and server owner. Password, email, deleting the account and the server list are under ⚙️ Settings → 🌍 Account. ♻️ Respawn (⚙️ Settings) deletes your colonies, hero, quests and alliance place on one server and lands you again with a new colony; your account and your other servers stay. The hand-over to a server works once and only for ten minutes.")));
